        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen fluoride, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen fluoride, at plant
Basic inventory based on own assumptions.;
CAS number: 73602-61-6; 
Formula: HF; 
Synonyms: Flusssäure; 
UUID: 3423baf7-2d25-3025-a6e8-94a7b7bc9da2
Production of hydrogen fluoride from fluorspar and sulphuric acid.
Location: Hydrogen fluoride is produced in different countries.
Technology: Endothermic reaction of CaF2 and H2SO4.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: About 53'000 metric tonnes in the US.
Sampling: Own estimations. 
Extrapolations: Own assumptions for desaggregation of published cumulative data on energy use.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3423baf7-2d25-3025-a6e8-94a7b7bc9da2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
